20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；子句及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLits}\">\\(\\mathrm{CLits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ict}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\mid\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)\\leq C(a))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ict}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\mid\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)\\leq C(a))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Ict}(f)\\mid\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\;(C_{\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}\\notin\\mathrm{Ict}(f))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Ict}(f)\\mid\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\;(C_{\\mathrm{CLits}(C)\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}\\notin\\mathrm{Ict}(f))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>implicant 是蕴含 f 的项，implicate 是被 f 蕴含的子句；prime implicate 是更短子句无法继续蕴含约束 f 的极小子句。为保持两个角色分明，新增本目录定义，不借用外部原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · 